Author: Goga
CreatedAt: 10/09/26
Description: |
  Project settings of prettyplay: the validated [tool.prettyplay] schema with the nested browser group (engine, screen mode, headless, endpoint, dialog auto-accept, pace, page action timeout), the strict replay-only switch, the generation and classification instructions, the generation compliance switch, the candidate probe bound, and the loader with flat env overrides for the group, the removed-flat-key rejection, explicit per-test merging that reaches inside the group and the actionable configuration error.
